{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "a23e61b490fd03c3f4433a21ef917befe87518c99d001bf55243a1bc800936d4", "ja": "明日へのバトン", "zh": "传向明天的接力棒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "540d1ecf542cada0fcd1276b67a0254717bb76432395dd4e5f2fb24d60c47cc6", "ja": "ライブイベントの成功によりこけら落とし\n公演のチケットは完売。明日の本番に向け\n弾みをつけたTeam7thは改めて互いを\n鼓舞する。1stから繋いだバトンは、\nいよいよ明日アンカーに渡るのだ。", "zh": "现场活动圆满成功，开幕演出\n公演门票全部售罄。为明天的正式演出\n鼓足干劲的Team7th再次\n彼此鼓舞。从1st接过的接力棒，\n终于要在明天交到最后一棒手中了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "0fc5608e65bffd67dd11ff3308f0af336da55aba063914e8b46609156af05181", "ja": "劇場での合宿最終日\nこけら落とし公演前日……", "zh": "剧场集训最后一天  \n首场公演前一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "f78f398028476ad31bb2a2cb9eb54d84e0cb33afef46bcf57627475919d02bfb", "ja": "コホン。え～、明日はいよいよこけら落とし公演だけど\nTeam7thのみんなには、大事な報告があります。", "zh": "咳咳。呃～，明天终于就要举行揭幕公演了，不过……\nTeam7th的各位，我有一件重要的事要告诉大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "4e2ebcd45b0800c9d2ac07cbd3b73b3497dabe75a67b1b621eabde4ec9677486", "ja": "先週みんなに出てもらったライブイベントの後、\n明日のチケットが大きく売上を伸ばしまして……。", "zh": "上周大家参加的现场活动结束后，明天公演的门票销量大幅上升了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1003_401pro", "source_sha256": "9fb8f43d4f6f058e206165dea882c391fe8fab72bf85e0774db48b16059691dc", "ja": "こけら落とし公演『レイズ・ザ・ドリーム』、\n無事全席ソールドアウトしました！　ありがとう！", "zh": "开幕公演《Raise the Dream》已顺利全部售罄！谢谢大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "bd9ace98e4c6e47f5ff05df78db7675f42b761b73720baca3143aee039e44c71", "ja": "イェーーーイ！！", "zh": "耶————！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
