{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bd9ace98e4c6e47f5ff05df78db7675f42b761b73720baca3143aee039e44c71", "ja": "イェーーーイ！！", "zh": "耶————！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "38aa4435a172238ee7398515a4803205c3301eca7aa0f59d90de52c426fe94d7", "ja": "合宿とライブイベント、並行して大変だったと\n思うけど……本当によくやり切ってくれた！", "zh": "合宿和活动演出同时进行，我想应该挺辛苦的……\n不过你们真的好好坚持到最后了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "678bcf19e48a04f9d25fb3064e5dd92f9c3bdcd57aef5cccb74deb5eb12ce31d", "ja": "えへへ、実はちょっと心配だったんですけど～、\nやってみたら、意外と平気でした！", "zh": "嘿嘿，其实我还有点担心来着～不过试着做了之后，意外地还挺顺利的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "ae433f6dbf3fdad73cf7767d69ef8a4a760bb910fc4df96114961f8e0f574d41", "ja": "うんうん♪　合宿もレッスンもライブも楽しかったし、\n一粒で何度も楽しい、みたいな感じだったね♪", "zh": "嗯嗯♪ 集训、练习和演出都很开心，感觉就像一粒米能带来好几次快乐一样呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "72994343e2c3c7cb740d7bd15b187844578571a83eddfbc901a3a212741b2da3", "ja": "いや～、ライブは最初、ちょっとビビっちゃったけど、\nもう全然大丈夫だったよね！　さすがアタシ達♪", "zh": "哎呀～，演出刚开始的时候我虽然有点被吓到了，\n不过后来完全没问题了呢！真不愧是我们♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "3aa7b09f3776d3561b6858e321dafe8db4df2fda75b90ccfaa6161a191518ac4", "ja": "本番での可奈の歌も最高だったしな。\n練習の成果、バッチリ出てたんじゃないか？", "zh": "正式演出时可奈的歌也棒极了。练习的成果，发挥得相当出色吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "d5e6563320ecaa0aca6947b59507c6f483c8ba29287ef8210bedb81c30f3be72", "ja": "え、最高……！？\nそんなに良かったんですか！？", "zh": "诶，最棒……！？\n真的有那么好吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "63852092a6c2b43e8eebf0dc0309d11f7f62f3ee29f2d916f19dce780f421e3b", "ja": "ああ、音程で苦労してたのに、たいしたもんだ。\n明日も期待してるぜ！", "zh": "啊，明明之前还为音准苦恼，真是了不起。\n明天也期待你的表现啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "fe5645fb3b94efb6b6381da9f48143ac2f0cfc7c57ebeacf59ed1452c662357d", "ja": "は、はいっ、がんばります！\nえへ、可奈にお任せ、らんらら～ん♪", "zh": "是、是的，我会加油的！\n嘿嘿，交给可奈吧，啦啦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "9e2644813c099bd9cf32aac30a9c3831a477f38cc316d91ffc3dda06564602f9", "ja": "というわけで、明日がこけら落とし公演本番だ。\n体調も準備も、万全に整えておこう。", "zh": "所以，明天就是首场公演正式上演的日子了。  \n身体状态和准备工作，都要调整到最佳状态。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "d05410f43e770ae9dd0f5638bf85a9c2323c6b6c181248bd0cfc753eb364eca2", "ja": "いよいよ明日か……。\nでもさ。ウチらの場合、不安なんか全っ然ないよな？", "zh": "终于要到明天了啊……\n不过呢，换成我们的话，根本就完～全不会感到不安吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d410f8580ff26b18089eceaf5fd8444d495ddb1d183c9dbdbcde25f62e26f7ae", "ja": "うん！　アタシ達、こないだ\n最高の経験をしちゃったからね！", "zh": "嗯！我们前阵子可是经历了最棒的体验呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "a6378ce00c79fcda18015609e83cc3a43be3a26f6ff6619511aaf000e7c08763", "ja": "アイドルの登竜門、通っちゃいましたからね！\n何でもこいこい、どんとこい～♪", "zh": "偶像界的登龙门，我们可是已经通过了呢！  \n不管来什么都尽管来，放马过来吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "546210347cb73528358fdee53b26e186020cf6816c5a39821fad52939b38c87b", "ja": "じゃあ、今日は明日に備えて、みんなで熟睡だね♪\nジュリアちゃんも夜に屋上行かないでね♪", "zh": "那今天就为明天做好准备，大家一起睡个好觉吧♪\n小茱莉亚晚上也别去屋顶哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "21266d6815b0130fb4441710f647cfa2d76bb65b070498a81cf799a113329d6f", "ja": "ああ、もう行かな……\nえええええっ！？", "zh": "啊啊，不能再去……\n诶诶诶诶诶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1fd834f4f960724a452ec0a9bcb814252ce0c1a13244661216e749a38a4fdc71", "ja": "？　どしたのジュリア？", "zh": "？怎么了，茱莉亚？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "36d59743e7e13398af5f522e28aa84560c1836ed4d1b4a7872ec213f19dbbe9d", "ja": "？　屋上？", "zh": "？屋顶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "c296b40ba13d43919e5084e2ee46f8cdb21c6c560d3d7f8289a0925c4ad7c899", "ja": "なんでもない、なんでもないんだ！！\nおい、バカP！！　あんたか、あんたなのか！？", "zh": "没事，没事的！！  \n喂，笨蛋P！！是你吗，是你干的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "42259957bb478d674953481ad490ef89f7da8861b04482308e404fdf6559a0de", "ja": "ち、違う違う！\n俺は誰にも言ってない！！", "zh": "不、不对不对！\n我没告诉任何人！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1026_048rei", "source_sha256": "06cca0cf75326e94e52bf81b75c0aa273227b4f258382e2c71aee1f46b142b52", "ja": "こないだ夜中にたまたま劇場をさまよってたら、\nジュリアちゃんを見つけちゃったのです！　えっへん♪", "zh": "前几天半夜偶然在剧场里闲逛时，发现了茱莉亚哦！哼哼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "a98c889e6fd71959e432454c6edb2a8537a7d675a426af8a62b57a3722581a2e", "ja": "なんで夜中にたまたま劇場をさまようんだよ！？\nあと自慢するな！！", "zh": "为什么会大半夜碰巧在剧场里乱逛啊！？  \n还有，别得意了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "459ec79d8cf25238b82bddc5684de956a327e3cbb0f4c5f3b59fa7e4ab767efe", "ja": "はーい♪　でも屋上で特訓してたジュリアちゃんは、\n自慢していいと思うな♪", "zh": "好——♪不过，我觉得在屋顶特训的茱莉亚，可以炫耀一下哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "662388d9b4d5d2ac60046132152d9f307676380373149008d0b52d95d4ad025d", "ja": "くぅ……！\n全部見てたのか……！", "zh": "呜……！\n你全都看到了吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1030_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bc89c5b0c058d504d3a6f819843a7fd75cd6d2d4a347a3b1cd233dc916d09294", "ja": "マジで！？　ジュリア、夜中にそんなことしてたの？\nも～、水臭いじゃん！　誘ってよ！", "zh": "真的假的！？茱莉亚，你半夜居然在做那种事？\n真是的～也太见外了吧！叫上我啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "e19a52d6b20e3d941b2ab1b1bddd2c23c99bb2313430657fdb1cd813b16e1049", "ja": "そうですよ～。私もジュリアさんと一緒に\n夜の特訓したかったです！　……起きれたら！", "zh": "就是嘛～我也想和茱莉亚先生一起进行夜间特训！……前提是能起得来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1032_050jul", "source_sha256": "013854e719c0d53f1f477d0ee70fd4c356f9f7115979e8e2861ea8ce5598d7a9", "ja": "い、いいんだよ！　ごく個人的な内容だし。\nそれに、もうやらないし。……整理、できたからな。", "zh": "没、没事啦！纯属我个人的事。\n而且，之后也不会再搞了。……因为已经整理好思绪了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_05_1033_048rei", "source_sha256": "599c91d7fef63c344561b6265bfb571a8f6b1d91cd73c706b655285d01793f56", "ja": "わぁ、やっぱりそうだったんだね？\nふふっ、よかった♪", "zh": "哇，果然是这样呢？\n呵呵，太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
